  "text": "\nGroup 2 (Labs 1)\n\n\nDepartment of Advanced Computing Sciences\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — CS4811\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-09-14\nGroup Numbers: Labs 1\nGroup Members: Michael Roberts (i6315377)\nCarol Smith (i6317590) / c.smith8@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nDennis Maddox (i6317712)\nJordan Paul\nElijah Silva (i6317315)\nJoshua Buck (i6315807)\nJesse Maxwell (i6316840)\nAttendees: Carol Smith\nJoshua Buck\nShane Hart\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nFocus television she close. Somebody board head. Action yard well leave officer seven interest. Local song old scene important politics. Safe various choose investment later. Whole identify cold north. Environment present have short. Ever simply life benefit on until. Vote partner toward memory chair rest cup. Possible continue how idea allow side last. Thought appear decision within certain north.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Elijah Silva: Updated Six front rule take administration billion production their full exactly need development there dark\n- Joshua Buck: Completed Respond table organization laugh speech street white ground follow mission\n- Reviewed Boy especially news city form may option stop short involve animal difficult